        "Method 2: Push Notifications",
        "Event Payload"
      ],
      "Text": "When member data changes, you\u0027ll receive a FEDERATED_MEMBER_DATA_STATUS_CHANGE event with the following structure:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
